  "write_times": {
   "description": "The `status` and `write_times` fields of GET /v1/health. `write_times.tables` has an entry per append-only table with a recorded write-time start M (`since`), and one with `ok` false and `since` null for an append-only table that needs an M and has none; `problems` names the Parquet files modified after M that hold rows without scraped_at (at most 20; `unstamped_files` counts them). `status` is \"degraded\" when `write_times.ok` is false. A consumer refuses to read a table whose entry has `ok` false.",
